# Trading Brains — TFT Price Prediction

Hourly stock/ETF price predictions using a Temporal Fusion Transformer (TFT),
served via Cloud Run and retrained on Vertex AI. Each ticker (e.g. SPY, GOOG)
has its own trained model, stored separately in GCS.


## Architecture Overview

Polygon.io (training data) 
Twelve Data (inference data)
| |
v v
Vertex AI Custom Job Cloud Run Service
(pipeline/train.py) (main.py)
| |
v v
gs://tft-for-trading-brains/ BigQuery: tft_predictions_logs
tft_checkpoint_{TICKER}_latest.ckpt (with ticker column)
|
+-------> Cloud Run loads per-ticker on first request



