├── checkpoints/ # Local training checkpoints
├── models/ # Local model copies
└── readme # This file




## API Endpoints (Cloud Run)

| Endpoint          | Method   | Description                                    |
|-------------------|----------|------------------------------------------------|
| `/`               | GET      | Health check                                   |
| `/predict`        | GET/POST | Generate predictions, save to BigQuery         |
| `/test`           | GET/POST | Test model with historical data (no BQ write)  |
| `/record_actuals` | GET/POST | Record actual prices for past predictions      |
| `/backfill`       | GET/POST | Recalculate all historical predictions         |

All endpoints accept a `?ticker=` query parameter (default: `SPY`). Examples:
- `/predict?ticker=SPY`
- `/predict?ticker=GOOG`
- `/test?ticker=GOOG`

Predictions are triggered hourly by Cloud Scheduler jobs (one pair per ticker).

### Cloud Scheduler Jobs

| Job name                     | URI                              | Schedule (ET)         |
|------------------------------|----------------------------------|-----------------------|
| `tft-hourly-prediction`      | `/predict` (SPY)                 | `:00` 10am–4pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-record-actuals`         | `/record_actuals` (SPY)          | `:05` 11am–5pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-hourly-prediction-goog` | `/predict?ticker=GOOG`           | `:00` 10am–4pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-record-actuals-goog`    | `/record_actuals?ticker=GOOG`    | `:05` 11am–5pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-hourly-prediction-qqq`  | `/predict?ticker=QQQ`            | `:00` 10am–4pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-record-actuals-qqq`     | `/record_actuals?ticker=QQQ`     | `:05` 11am–5pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-hourly-prediction-tsla` | `/predict?ticker=TSLA`           | `:00` 10am–4pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-record-actuals-tsla`    | `/record_actuals?ticker=TSLA`    | `:05` 11am–5pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-hourly-prediction-aapl` | `/predict?ticker=AAPL`           | `:00` 10am–4pm Mon–Fri|
| `tft-record-actuals-aapl`    | `/record_actuals?ticker=AAPL`    | `:05` 11am–5pm Mon–Fri|


